  _pages:
  - Image: {fileID: 0}
    Video: {fileID: 32900000, guid: 7bae6ea8dcbb0de4592bc10473508c99, type: 3}
    Title: Skill Points (SP)
    Body: 'The SP bar at the top left shows your stored power.

      Fill it to 10 to enter Special mode. The gun then fires a powerful cursed shot. A special shot uses Full SP.'
  - Image: {fileID: 0}
    Video: {fileID: 32900000, guid: 7bae6ea8dcbb0de4592bc10473508c99, type: 3}
    Title: Gaining SP
    Body: 'Increase your SP by fighting effectively:

      Landing melee attacks adds SP. Parrying an attack adds SP quickly. Perform a Glory Kill to gain a large amount of SP.'
  - Image: {fileID: 0}
    Video: {fileID: 32900000, guid: 7bae6ea8dcbb0de4592bc10473508c99, type: 3}
    Title: SP Decreases
    Body: 'Unused SP starts decaying after 10 seconds, losing 1 SP per second.

      SP also resets to zero when you use the normal gun mode. Use normal shots when you are saving SP for a powerful special shot.'
